    {
      "id": "section:0/block:37/seg:0",
      "source": "**Beyond the book:** [Career Chats with Swyx and Randall](https://swyx.io/podcasts#career-chats-episodes) explores developer careers in conversation, including staff engineering, when to quit your job, and getting into developer advocacy.",
