    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Code is only one part of a coding career.",
      "source_hash": 10956220549507644645,
      "context_hash": 8926800374737422270,
      "translation": "코드는 코딩 커리어의 일부일 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "coding career": "코딩 커리어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-29T16:34:33.624880Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The harder work is choosing what to learn, finding the right rooms, navigating teams, making career bets, and growing from code newbie to senior—and beyond.",
      "source_hash": 14088306527217299835,
      "context_hash": 120650578711012460,
      "translation": "더 어려운 일은 무엇을 배울지 정하고, 알맞은 자리를 찾고, 팀 안에서 길을 찾고, 커리어에 걸 승부를 정하고, 코드 뉴비에서 시니어로, 그리고 그 너머로 성장하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Code Newbie": "코드 뉴비"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-29T16:34:33.624880Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Written in a twelve-week sprint in 2020, *The Coding Career Handbook* distills Shawn “swyx” Wang’s second-career journey into a practical field guide for everything around the code.",
